+| 6 | 2 | 4 | 16 |
+| 10 | 10 | 60 | 240 |
+| 12 | 0 | 80 | 320 |
+| 14 | 70 | 1,092 | 4,368 |
+| 16 | 16 | 2,728 | 10,888 (8 Clifford tori, χ′ = 0) |
+| 18 | 498 | 23,508 | 94,032 |
+| 20 | 320 | running | running |
+
