+|---|---|---|
+| 5 (proved, §3) | 0.5652 | 0.1394 |
+| 4 | 0.7024 | 0.1721 |
+| 3 | 0.9237 | 0.2231 |
+| 2.5 (near the measured growth) | 1.0741 | 0.2565 |
